Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790701199999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790639999999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The 2850 high was not followed by a trend bar: 1790035200000 is an inside bar and 1790121600000 closed 2684.16 below its open, leaving 1790639999999 162 points under the high.", "1787270400000 left a ~256-point upper tail (high 2771 vs close 2515.3), and the following 27 bars could not exceed 2680, showing repeated failure to hold new highs.", "The final four bars are near-doji small-range bars (2636.28-2740.42), a tight two-sided cluster at the trend extreme that fits a final-flag shape rather than trend resumption.", "Two earlier vertical spikes in this window (1787097600000, 1787270400000) were each followed by multi-week ranges, so a stall after the 2850 high is consistent with this window's prior behavior."], "evidence_for": ["Progression of higher swing highs and higher swing lows over the last 40 bars: lows 2357.18 (1788307200000), 2358.62 (1789430400000), 2436.87 (1789689600000) and 2633.31 (1790208000000).", "1789689600000-1789948800000 broke above the 27-bar range and above the prior 2771 spike high, with closes near the highs and acceptance above 2612.02.", "The last seven bars hold entirely above the 2612.02 breakout close and above the 2436.87 breakout-low; no bear bar has closed below a prior bull swing low.", "Buying continued after each consolidation: ranges following the 2293.8/2771 spike highs and after the 27-bar range were all resolved upward."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window opens at 2006.31 (1780272000000) and sells off to a 1368.42 low (1780704000000) on bars that close near their lows.", "Price then recovers into a long overlapping range around 1710-1975 (e.g. 1692.84 low at 1782000000000 to 1974.46 high at 1785110400000) that persists until 1787011200000.", "1787097600000 is a large bull trend bar (open 1916.51, high 2293.8, close 2252.16), followed by closes of 2326.32 (1787184000000) and 2515.3 with a 2771 high (1787270400000): a three-bar vertical bull spike.", "From 1787356800000 to 1789603200000 the market holds a 27-bar two-sided range between 2357.18 (1788307200000 low) and 2680 (1789084800000 high), repeatedly rejecting 2520-2557 and 2357-2400 with heavy body overlap.", "1789689600000-1789948800000 breaks above that range and above the 2771 spike high: closes 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.9, 2775.61, with the 2850 high at 1789948800000.", "The new high lacks strong follow-through: 1790035200000 is an inside bar and 1790121600000 closes 2684.16 below its open.", "The last seven bars (1790035200000-1790553600000) are overlapping, with the final four trading 2636.28-2740.42 and 1790639999999 closing 2687.88, roughly mid-range and 162 below the 2850 high."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Multi-month bull swing from the 1368.42 low to the 2850 high, with successively higher swing lows (1512.91, 1533.12, 2357.18, 2436.87, 2633.31) across the supplied window.", "end_time_ms": 1790639999999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780704000000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Three-bar vertical bull spike following a long two-sided range: open 1916.51 to close 2252.16 (1787097600000), close 2326.32 (1787184000000), then a 2771 high with a 2515.3 close and a large upper tail (1787270400000).", "end_time_ms": 1787270400000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Twenty-seven-bar two-sided range after the spike: repeated highs 2520-2557 plus the 2680 spike high at 1789084800000, and repeated lows 2357-2400 with 2357.18 at 1788307200000 and 2358.62 at 1789430400000; no sustained close beyond either edge.", "end_time_ms": 1789603200000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Four-bar bull breakout above the 27-bar range and above the 2771 spike high, closing near highs at 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.9 and 2775.61, with the 2850 high printed at 1789948800000.", "end_time_ms": 1789948800000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2436.87", "start_time_ms": 1789689600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Tight seven-bar consolidation just under the 2850 high; the last four bars are small overlapping dojis traded between 2636.28 and 2740.42, with no close beyond the 2612.02 breakout close and final close 2687.88.", "end_time_ms": 1790639999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1790035200000, "upper_boundary": "2786.81"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: a close above 2786.81 and then 2850 on a trend bar with follow-through, and a higher low above 2633.31, would confirm resumption of the bull channel.", "A bear body closing below 2633.31 and then below the 2612.02 breakout close would suggest the breakout has failed and shift the read toward a trading range or transition-unclear.", "A close below 2436.87 would break the most recent bull swing low and question the always-in-long classification.", "Continued overlapping bars contained between 2633.31 and 2786.81 with no boundary close would keep the current read of a bull trend in a breakout-mode tight range."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "unclear", "always_in_relevance": "low", "breakout_mode": false, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790697599999, "directional_pressure": "balanced", "evidence_against": ["The window's dominant swing is still bullish: 2358.62 (bar 37) to 2850 (bar 71), about +20%, with two spike legs and higher swing lows; the 46-bar range sits above that leg's midpoint near 2604, a common bull-flag position.", "Higher lows inside the range (2633.31 bar 89, then 2637 bar 112, 2643.44 bar 111, 2652.27 bar 117) plus the highest close since bar 95 at 2732.01 (bar 119) support a bull-channel/flag continuation instead of neutral two-sided balance.", "Bar 120 is a strong bear reversal bar (O 2732.01 C 2671.58, 1.58 above the low) that erased the bodies of bars 118-119; followed through, it would favor a bearish lower high after the 2850 spike rather than a balanced range.", "The lower-high sequence is not clean: bar 120's high 2742.12 is above bar 95's 2740.42, and one reversal bar cannot define range edges."], "evidence_for": ["Bars 75-120 (46 bars) remain inside 2633.31-2804.59 with overlapping bodies and no two consecutive closes outside that band.", "Range extremes were rejected within a few bars in both directions: 2804.59 (bar 74) to 2648.49 (bar 84); 2633.31 (bar 89) back to 2694.09 (bar 91).", "The 2850 spike (bar 71) was not accepted: bar 72 topped at 2795 and no close printed above 2800 for the following 49 bars.", "Recent bars are small and two-sided: bars 98-103 all close between 2683.22 and 2691.88 with 0.76-8.66-point bodies, versus the 98-point body of bar 12.", "Highs after the spike form a flattening sequence (2850, 2804.59, 2786.81, 2740.42, 2742.12) while lows hold near 2633.31-2652.27, i.e. rotation rather than a directional trend."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window of 120 closed H4 bars (1788969600000-1790697599999); window low 2358.62 (bar 37, close 2412.95) and window high 2850 (bar 71, close 2723.15).", "Bar 12 (open 1789128000000): O 2457.12 H 2680 L 2444.19 C 2555.52, a 235.81-point bull bar closing 124.48 below its high after 11 bars of 2440-2483 overlap.", "Bars 13-32 gave back bar 12's spike (closes 2511.99 bar 15, 2514.07 bar 32 after a 2609.02 high), then bars 33-37 declined to 2358.62.", "Bars 37-74 rose with bull spikes at bar 54 (O 2507.15 C 2578.6), bar 55 (O 2579.97 C 2636.28) and bar 71 (O 2658.81 H 2850 C 2723.15); bar 72 reached 2795 but closed 2754.31.", "Bars 75-120 (46 bars) stay inside 2633.31 (bar 89 low) and 2804.59 (bar 74 high), with no two consecutive closes outside that band and small, heavily overlapping bodies.", "Both boundaries failed to hold: 2804.59 (bar 74) led down to 2648.49 (bar 84, O 2726.71 C 2659.0) with recovery to 2694.09 by bar 91; 2633.31 (bar 89) led back to 2694.09.", "Bars 98-103 are a tight middle-of-range cluster, every close between 2683.22 and 2691.88 with bodies of 0.76-8.66 points.", "Bars 111-119 stepped up (lows 2643.44, 2637, 2652.27) closing at 2710.21 (bar 118) and 2732.01 (bar 119), the highest close since bar 95 (2715.9) and above bar 106's 2717.24.", "Bar 120 (open 1790683200000): O 2732.01 H 2742.12 L 2670 C 2671.58, a 72.12-point bear bar closing 1.58 above its low; its high is the highest since bar 95's 2740.42 and its close is below the opens of bars 118-119."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "trading-range", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Post-spike trading range: after the 2850 spike high (bar 71) the market spent 46 bars rotating between roughly 2633 and 2805, with overlapping bodies, alternating closes and no acceptance outside the band. Upper reference is bar 74's high; lower reference is bar 89's low, retested near 2637 (bar 112) and 2643.44 (bar 111).", "end_time_ms": 1790697599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1790035200000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}, {"description": "Failed bull breakout attempt: bar 71 (O 2658.81) spiked to 2850 and closed 2723.15; bar 72 reached 2795 but closed 2754.31. No close followed above 2800, and bars 75-85 gave the move back to 2641.37, so the breakout was never accepted. Exact spike high 2850 (bar 71) is above the range's working upper reference 2804.59.", "end_time_ms": 1790179199999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": null, "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": null}, {"description": "Latest up-leg and reversal bar: bars 111-119 built higher lows (2643.44, 2637, 2652.27) and closed up to 2732.01 (bar 119), then bar 120 printed H 2742.12 (a marginal ~25-bar high above bar 95's 2740.42) and reversed to close 2671.58, engulfing the bodies of bars 118-119. One bar only; no follow-through yet.", "end_time_ms": 1790697599999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2643.44", "start_time_ms": 1790553600000, "upper_boundary": "2742.12"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Acceptance above 2804.59: one close above it followed by a second close above 2804.59 would shift the read to a bull breakout in breakout-spike phase.", "Acceptance below 2633.31: a close below 2633.31 with the next bar also closing below it would mark a bear breakout of the 46-bar range and a lower-high/lower-low structure after the 2850 spike.", "Bar 120 follow-through: another close below 2670 with a high below 2742.12 reinforces the bear reversal; a close back above 2742.12 or 2732.56 voids it.", "Continued overlap of closes between 2643.44 and 2742.12 for the next 5-10 bars keeps the range/two-sided classification and the low Always-In relevance."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2668.61", "close_time_ms": 1790272799999, "high": "2687.33", "low": "2666.79", "open": "2686.28", "open_time_ms": 1790269200000, "volume": "1906449.096"}, {"close": "2689.04", "close_time_ms": 1790276399999, "high": "2692.07", "low": "2660.49", "open": "2668.13", "open_time_ms": 1790272800000, "volume": "2051051.497"}, {"close": "2694.09", "close_time_ms": 1790279999999, "high": "2699.39", "low": "2681.88", "open": "2689.08", "open_time_ms": 1790276400000, "volume": "2095245.053"}, {"close": "2686.66", "close_time_ms": 1790283599999, "high": "2695.78", "low": "2682.01", "open": "2694.09", "open_time_ms": 1790280000000, "volume": "1551632.803"}, {"close": "2684.97", "close_t